   "fix": "Add `@[simp] theorem pointIndexedCore_trivializationAt (b : B) : trivializationAt F (pointIndexedCore \ud835\udd5c F E).Fiber b = (pointIndexedCore \ud835\udd5c F E).localTriv b := (rfl)` and the matching `pointIndexedCore_localTrivAt`. Optionally also state the compatibility lemma with the core's `trivializationAt`, then simplify the inverse-continuity proof to use these lemmas.",
   "issue": "`trivializationAt_pointIndexedCoreHomeomorph` and the baseSet/indexAt simp lemmas only cover `(pointIndexedCore \ud835\udd5c F E).localTriv b`. Nothing links the core's `FiberBundle` chart `trivializationAt F (pointIndexedCore \ud835\udd5c F E).Fiber b` (equivalently `localTrivAt b`) to `localTriv b`, so consumers must unfold `VectorBundleCore.trivializationAt` and rewrite backwards through `localTrivAt_def` by hand, as the PR's own `continuous_pointIndexedCoreTotalEquiv_symm` does.",
